Z||000000||whamel||08-28-2000||12:13 AM||||Well, per the recommendation to use decal remover, I went out and found some at Autozone for about $2.99 a can.  I have to say, it worked wonderfully!  No damage at all to the finish of the rims as far as I can tell and it took the paint off after a couple applications.  (Get a couple cans, you'll need em.)  It scared the heck out of me when I first sprayed it on and it turned black, but that came off just fine.  (Whew!)  Now I have a new set of clean stock rims again.  I just thought I'd post my results here since a few people were interested in this when I asked originally.  Thanks to everybody who gave me advice on this topic.<BR>Thanks,<BR>Wade||||reg||3
